tvmail  --  a Turbo Vision mail client

Created and maintained by
    Chris Pollitt   <chris.pollitt@gmail.com>

Developed with pair-programming assistance from Claude (Anthropic).
See the "Co-Authored-By:" trailers in the git history for details.

Bundled at build time (cloned by build.sh, not stored in this repository):
    Turbo Vision   --   https://github.com/magiblot/tvision
        modern C++ port by magiblot of Borland's Turbo Vision framework.

Portions of src/tvmail.cpp (the Find / Replace dialog helpers) are adapted
from the `tvedit` example in the Turbo Vision distribution.
